The field allows only English letters, digits (0-9), and the following special characters: &apos;-&apos;, &apos;(&apos;, &apos;)&apos;, &apos;/&apos;, &apos;&apos;, &apos;@&apos;, &apos;&amp;&apos;, &apos;*&apos;, &apos;,&apos;, &apos;#&apos;, &apos;.&apos;, &apos;_&apos;, and space. Your input may not include any other characters.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Company Name - English Language</label>
        <length>255</length>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
